lectrical and lockout / stored energy.","worker exposure is not explicitly described.","shutdown or isolation should remain in place until effective controls are verified."],"riskStatement":"Risk is rated High.","decisionSummary":"Electrical was selected based on hazard signals, context, risk indicators, and standards alignment.","controlStatement":"Durable controls are represented in the recommendation set.","escalationFactors":["Supervisor review recommended by confidence intelligence.","Risk engine recommends shutdown or isolation.","Control intelligence recommends verification before closure."],"standardsStatement":"Top standards were selected from curated HazLenz AI mappings and CFR-backed matching where available.","confidenceStatement":"Overall confidence is 38%.","supervisorReviewRecommended":true},"candidateStandardFamily":"machine_guarding","citationLevelCandidates":[{"id":"review-osha-1910-147-loto","title":"Control of Hazardous Energy (Lockout/Tagout)","agency":"OSHA","citation":"29 CFR 1910.147","sourceId":"osha-1910-147-loto","confidence":0.38,"sourceTrace":["Governed by SourceGovernanceService"],"jurisdiction":"osha_general_industry","authorityTier":"primary_regulation","industryScope":["manufacturing"],"approvalStatus":"approved","prohibitedUses":[],"missingEvidence":[],"requiredEvidence":["LOTO status","energy isolation verification"],"evidenceSatisfied":true,"advisoryGuardrails":{"advisoryOnly":true,"doesNotDeclareViolation":true,"requiresQualifiedReview":true},"applicabilityNotes":[],"confidenceBoosters":[],"confidenceReducers":[],"humanReviewTriggers":["Critical hazard interaction"],"relatedHazardDomains":[],"relatedStandardFamily":"unknown","relatedTaskIndicators":[],"relatedScenarioFamilies":["conveyor-cleanup"],"relatedExposureIndicators":[],"relatedEquipmentIndicators":[],"relatedMechanismIndicators":[]}],"correlationIntelligence":{"recommendation":"Review related hazards together before assigning corrective actions.","cascadePotential":"elev